<section class="ph"><div class="wrap"><span class="kick">The Harbor Ledger</span><h1>Most read this week</h1><p>The ten stories readers opened most in the last seven days.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap narrow" style="padding:20px 28px 0">{% assign top = 0 %}{% for x in Target.Items %}{% if forloop.first %}{% assign top = x.PublishedContent.reads | append: "" | plus: 0 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- for x in Target.Items %}{% assign q = x.PublishedContent %}{% assign r = q.reads | append: "" | plus: 0 %}{% assign pct = r | times: 100 | divided_by: top %}
  <a class="mrr" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ x.RoutePath }}"><span class="rk">{{ forloop.index }}</span><span>{% capture kd %}{{ q.kind }}{% endcapture %}{% capture lv %}{{ q.is_live }}{% endcapture %}{% if lv == "True" %}<span class="kick">&#9679; Live</span>{% elsif kd == "analysis" %}<span class="kick">Analysis</span>{% elsif kd == "opinion" %}<span class="kick k-opinion">Opinion</span>{% elsif kd == "explainer" %}<span class="kick">Explainer</span>{% else %}<span class="kick" style="color:{{ q.section.PublishedContent.color }}">{{ q.section.PrimaryField }}</span>{% endif %}<h2 class="h-m hd" style="margin:6px 0 8px">{{ x.PrimaryField }}</h2><span class="bar"><i style="width:{{ pct }}%"></i></span><span class="mut" style="font-size:.8rem">{{ r | format_number: "N0" }} reads &middot; {{ q.author.PrimaryField }}</span></span></a>
{%- endfor %}
<div class="note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i><div><b>How this list works.</b> Each article has a "Reads in the last 7 days" number field, and this page is a Raytha list view sorted by that field. In this demo the numbers are seeded by hand. A real newsroom would have a nightly job copy counts from its analytics tool into the field through the Raytha API. Raytha does not count page views itself.</div></div>
</section>
<style>.mrr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mrr:first-of-type{border-top:0}.rk{font:800 2.6rem/1 var(--serif);color:var(--red)}
.bar{display:block;height:6px;background:var(--paper2);margin-bottom:6px;max-width:420px}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--ink)}
.note{display:flex;gap:12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 20px;margin-top:30px;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink2)}.note .bi{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy)}</style>
